  "details": "When applying a look with an accessory, my avatars head turns metallic in fallback shaders and some other fallback materials break.\n\nRepro:\n\nSelect an avatar.\n\nEnable fallback shaders from the avatars section of the radial menu (others see the same when your shaders are disabled as well).\n\nCreate a look for your avatar with at least one accessory.\n\nSee your fallback appearance breaks.\n\nVideo of this occurring attached.\n\nImage of how materials look with an accessory attached.\n\nI've seen this happen to other avatars, but in case this is avatar specific, this avatars ID is: avtr_7fe3df7a-eb5f-4a54-855e-5820589851d0",
